Welcome to WordLink v1.1

WordLink is a Scrabble (tm) type game written for Cnet in Arexx.

To Install:

Installation is VERY easy.  Simply unpack the wordlink.lha file into your
pfiles: directory and a directory called wordlink will be created which
contains all the necessary subdirectories and files.  All other necessary
files are created automatically when the program is run. 

Install wordlink.rex as an Arexx Pfile.  In the AT screen, set DISABLE MORE
to YES and, for the unregistered version, single player use only
should be turned on.  The registered version supports multiple players!

Add wlmaint.rex as an automaintenance item each day.... best if no one is
playing at the time so run it around 4:30am... everyone is sleeping then!

Please register this game for a much better game for everyday use on your
BBS.

That's it!

